1
00:00:05,870 --> 00:00:09,460
All right, it's a new day. That stuff about Rachel?
好了，這是全新的一天 關於瑞秋那件事呢？

2
00:00:09,700 --> 00:00:15,300
You don't feel that now. It was crazy. You're fine. You're better than fine.
現在你沒有感覺，那太瘋了 你沒事，你好的不得了

3
00:00:15,540 --> 00:00:19,950
You are, as your friend Tony would say, "Great!"
沒錯，就像你朋友湯尼說的 「太帥了」

4
00:00:22,520 --> 00:00:26,980
Everything's normal. She's just your friend, Rachel.
一切都很正常 瑞秋她只是你的朋友

5
00:00:27,220 --> 00:00:32,850
Your friend, Rachel. Your friend. Rachel.
你的朋友瑞秋 你的朋友瑞秋

6
00:00:33,700 --> 00:00:39,130
-Hi, sweetie. -Hey, it's your girlfriend, Rachel!
-嗨，甜心 -嗨，她是你女朋友瑞秋

7
00:00:40,640 --> 00:00:42,801
The One Where Chandler Takes A Bath
本集播出：錢德泡澡記

00:00:43,640 --> 00:00:44,801
rainystar壓制iPod-MP4

8
00:01:23,910 --> 00:01:26,070
Are you..? Are you high?
你…你很興奮嗎？

9
00:01:27,220 --> 00:01:29,410
I just had the most amazing bath.
我剛剛泡了一個最舒服的澡

10
00:01:29,650 --> 00:01:33,020
-Really? I don't like baths. -You like them with me.
-真的嗎？我不喜歡泡澡 -你喜歡跟我泡鴛鴦浴

11
00:01:33,290 --> 00:01:36,550
Honey, it's not the bath I enjoy. It's the wet, naked lady.
甜心，我不是喜歡泡澡 我是喜歡看全身濕答答的裸體女人

12
00:01:38,060 --> 00:01:42,090
-Baths are so relaxing. -Really? What do you do?
-泡澡能讓你放鬆 -真的嗎？你在裡面做什麼？

13
00:01:42,330 --> 00:01:45,660
You just sit in there, stewing in your own filth.
你坐在那裡 被自己的髒水泡著

14
00:01:47,440 --> 00:01:49,900
How dirty do you think I am?
你覺得我有多髒呢？

15
00:01:50,170 --> 00:01:54,730
If you had some candles and bubbles and music, you would love it.
如果有蠟燭、泡泡跟音樂

16
00:01:54,940 --> 00:01:57,070
It would take all of your stress away.
你一定會喜歡它的

17
00:01:54,981 --> 00:01:55,970
它會讓你完全地放鬆

18
00:01:57,310 --> 00:01:59,780
It's 2:00 on a Wednesday and I'm watching Road Rules.
現在是星期三兩點 我正在看越野單車賽

19
00:01:59,950 --> 00:02:02,180
How stressed do you think I am?
你覺得我的壓力會有多大

20
00:02:05,190 --> 00:02:09,090
Hey, Chandler. You got a minute? I really need to talk to you.
錢德，你有空嗎？ 我真的需要跟你談一談

21
00:02:09,460 --> 00:02:13,720
Oh, yeah. Is this a cold-pizza talk or a leftover-meat loaf talk?
對，這是冷披薩談話 還是烤肉剩菜談話？

22
00:02:13,900 --> 00:02:15,120
Well, neither.
都不是

23
00:02:16,100 --> 00:02:18,460
Oh, my God, what's up?
天啊，發生了什麼事？

24
00:02:19,670 --> 00:02:22,160
I don't know. It's just..
我不知道，那只是…

25
00:02:22,570 --> 00:02:25,700
Lately, I've been feeling..
最近我覺得…

26
00:02:26,840 --> 00:02:29,280
Okay, here's what it is.
好吧，事情是這樣的

27
00:02:33,780 --> 00:02:36,110
You know what? I feel a lot better. Thanks.
你知道嗎？ 我覺得好多了，謝謝

28
00:02:36,280 --> 00:02:39,580
No. Come back here and talk to me, mon frere.
不，快回來告訴我 猶豫先生

29
00:02:39,920 --> 00:02:42,080
-Who? -Just come back.
-誰？ -回來吧

30
00:02:42,960 --> 00:02:44,480
Okay.
好吧

31
00:02:46,460 --> 00:02:49,020
You and Monica, friends for a long time.
你跟摩妮卡 當了很久的朋友

32
00:02:49,260 --> 00:02:53,760
And sure, there are rules. But then you went to London.
當然這是有規則的 之後你們去了倫敦

33
00:02:54,000 --> 00:02:57,900
But that's different. There are rules there too, you know what I mean?
但那不一樣，這也是有規則的 你瞭解我的意思嗎？

34
00:02:58,640 --> 00:03:00,110
Do you?
是嗎？

35
00:03:03,040 --> 00:03:07,880
It was different for you guys. You were both in the same place, right?
對你們來說是不一樣的 你們剛好去了同一個地方，對吧？

36
00:03:08,050 --> 00:03:09,280
-In London? -Yeah.
-在倫敦？ -對

37
00:03:09,450 --> 00:03:13,010
Yes, when Monica and I were in London, we were both in London.
對，摩妮卡跟我在倫敦時 我們剛好都在那裡

38
00:03:13,450 --> 00:03:16,550
You know what. This is a bad idea. Forget all about it.
你知道嗎？這是個爛主意 算了

39
00:03:16,790 --> 00:03:20,020
And listen, do me a favor, this conversation between you and me.
聽著，幫我一個忙 別把這件事說出去

40
00:03:20,860 --> 00:03:22,800
If that.
我會盡力的

41
00:03:24,504 --> 00:03:26,836
（中央咖啡廳）

42
00:03:28,970 --> 00:03:31,530
How do I keep losing at tic-tac-toe?
為什麼我玩井字棋老是會輸呢？

43
00:03:31,710 --> 00:03:34,640
Oh, no, no, honey. My circle always stays in the middle.
不，甜心 我的圈圈一直都停留在中間

44
00:03:36,810 --> 00:03:40,180
Oh, Ross, don't forget we have that doctor's appointment tomorrow.
羅斯，別忘了 明天我們要一起去產檢

45
00:03:40,350 --> 00:03:43,550
-To find out the sex of the baby? -No. We don't wanna know.
-你們要知道寶寶的性別？ -不，我們不想知道

46
00:03:43,720 --> 00:03:46,120
All we care about is that it's happy and healthy.
我們只在乎 寶寶是不是健康快樂

47
00:03:46,290 --> 00:03:48,590
Yep, happy and healthy. And cute.
對，健康快樂，還有可愛

48
00:03:48,760 --> 00:03:51,550
-And smart. With an aptitude for science. -Popular.
-跟聰明，還要有科學精神 -受歡迎

49
00:03:51,760 --> 00:03:53,780
Are you two talking about the same baby?
你們兩個說的是 同一個寶寶嗎？

50
00:03:55,900 --> 00:03:59,990
-Hey, have you thought of names? -Oh, yeah. I've come up with a bunch.
-你們想到名字了嗎？ -對，我想到一大堆

51
00:04:00,200 --> 00:04:02,230
-Really? Me too. -Me too.
-真的嗎？我也是 -我也是

52
00:04:02,840 --> 00:04:04,630
Really?
真的？

53
00:04:04,870 --> 00:04:09,780
If it's a girl, Phoebe. And if it's a boy, Pheebo.
如果是女孩就叫菲比 如果是男孩就叫菲寶

54
00:04:11,950 --> 00:04:16,650
Maybe. But it wouldn't hurt to have a backup, you know?
或許吧，但想些備用名字 應該無傷大雅

55
00:04:16,920 --> 00:04:19,110
-Rach, what were you thinking? -Okay.
-瑞秋，你想到什麼名字？ -好吧

56
00:04:19,890 --> 00:04:22,290
I was thinking if it's a girl..
我想如果是女孩

57
00:04:22,520 --> 00:04:26,890
how about Sandrene? It's French.
叫她珊德妮好嗎？那是法文

58
00:04:27,130 --> 00:04:31,330
That's a really pretty name for an industrial solvent.
那很適合化學溶劑公司

59
00:04:34,640 --> 00:04:37,970
-Okay, fine. What do you have? -It's for a boy.
-好吧，你想到什麼？ -我想到男生的名字

60
00:04:38,170 --> 00:04:40,570
I know it's a little out there, but..
我知道那沒有什麼，但是…

61
00:04:41,910 --> 00:04:43,540
Darwin.
達爾文

62
00:04:44,910 --> 00:04:48,400
Oh, my God. Our child will be beaten to death in the schoolyard.
天啊，我們的孩子 會在操場上被打死

63
00:04:48,620 --> 00:04:50,480
Yeah, by Sandrene.
對，被珊德妮打死

64
00:04:51,350 --> 00:04:54,150
You're saying that because I said no to your name.
你會那麼說 因為我不喜歡你想的名字

65
00:04:54,360 --> 00:04:56,620
I'm really, really not.
我真的沒有

66
00:04:56,820 --> 00:04:59,260
How about you each get five vetoes?
你們何不各想五個名字？

67
00:04:59,460 --> 00:05:03,830
-That sounds fair. -I don't think you'll need it. Check this out.
-聽起來很公平 -我想你不需要，聽著

68
00:05:04,100 --> 00:05:07,500
If it's a girl, Rain.
如果是女孩就叫做小雨

69
00:05:08,370 --> 00:05:11,570
-Veto. -Why?
-否決 -為什麼？

70
00:05:11,810 --> 00:05:15,170
Rain? "Hi, my name is Rain.
小雨？嗨，我叫小雨

71
00:05:15,440 --> 00:05:20,040
I have my own kiln, and my dress is made out of wheat."
我有自己的爐子 我的衣服是用麥子做的

72
00:05:21,580 --> 00:05:23,810
I know her!
我認識她

73
00:05:24,090 --> 00:05:26,610
I bought a homemade soap from her at a Dead show!
我在死人表演裡 跟她買了一塊手工肥皂

74
00:05:29,090 --> 00:05:34,790
-Okay. How about for a guy, Thatcher? -Why do you hate our child?
-好，如果是女孩就叫她柴契爾 -你為什麼那麼恨我們的孩子？

75
00:05:35,000 --> 00:05:37,970
-Fine, you go. -Okay. James.
-好吧，輪到你了 -詹姆斯

76
00:05:39,230 --> 00:05:41,600
-But only if it's a girl. -Veto.
-但我可能生的是女孩 -否決

77
00:05:41,840 --> 00:05:44,330
I like Ruth. What about Ruth?
我喜歡蘿絲，你覺得呢？

78
00:05:44,540 --> 00:05:47,700
Oh, I'm sorry. Are we having an 89-year-old?
抱歉 我們要生下89歲的寶寶？

79
00:05:50,110 --> 00:05:52,740
-How about Dayton? -Veto. Stewart.
-戴頓呢？ -否決，史都華

80
00:05:52,980 --> 00:05:54,610
Veto. Sawyer.
否決，莎耶

81
00:05:54,820 --> 00:05:57,150
-Veto. Helen. -Veto.
-否決，海倫 -否決

82
00:05:57,490 --> 00:06:00,450
Is it me, or is Veto starting to sound really good?
是我想歪了 還是否決會是個好名字？

83
00:06:06,360 --> 00:06:09,020
Boy, do I have a surprise for you.
天啊，我為你準備了一個大驚喜

84
00:06:09,230 --> 00:06:11,130
Sex on the balcony?
我們要在陽台上做愛？

85
00:06:11,330 --> 00:06:14,790
No. But someone's not gonna get over that idea.
不，但有個人 忘不了那個想法

86
00:06:15,640 --> 00:06:17,760
-What is it? -I drew you a bath.
-怎麼了？ -我幫你放了洗澡水

87
00:06:18,010 --> 00:06:21,910
I don't like baths. Could you draw me a picture of us having sex on the balcony?
我不喜歡洗澡 你願意跟我去陽台上做愛嗎？

88
00:06:23,080 --> 00:06:25,940
Please. Will you just try it for me. I used all my best stuff.
拜託你試試看 我使出了全身解數

89
00:06:26,210 --> 00:06:31,520
I lit candles, I put on music. I used bath salts, plus bubble bath.
我點了蠟燭，放了音樂 用了浴鹽跟泡泡澡

90
00:06:31,750 --> 00:06:36,950
And got you this little plastic Navy ship! So it's a boy bath.
我還幫你找到海軍模型船 這是男人會洗的澡

91
00:06:38,160 --> 00:06:43,360
-This does butch it up a bit. -I swear, if you try it, you will love it.
-這稍微有點男人味 -我發誓你試過後一定會愛上它

92
00:06:43,560 --> 00:06:46,660
If I do this, can we at least discuss sex on the balcony?
如果我這麼做 我們能不能討論在陽台上做愛的事？

93
00:06:46,870 --> 00:06:48,170
Absolutely.
當然可以

94
00:06:49,900 --> 00:06:52,370
But I know how that discussion's gonna go.
但我知道 我們會怎麼討論它

95
00:07:01,220 --> 00:07:07,450
All right, this isn't so bad. I like the flowery smell.
好吧，這還不賴 我喜歡花香味

96
00:07:08,190 --> 00:07:11,320
Which is okay, because I've got my boat.
沒關係 因為我有我的船

97
00:07:12,990 --> 00:07:17,260
I can actually feel my tension just melting away.
我可以感覺到 壓力消除了

98
00:07:17,430 --> 00:07:19,530
I could fall asleep in here.
我快睡著了

99
00:07:19,700 --> 00:07:22,100
I could drown in here.
我可能會被淹死

100
00:07:23,670 --> 00:07:25,760
Drowning.
我快淹死了

101
00:07:28,540 --> 00:07:31,600
-So? -Oh, my God.
-怎麼樣？ -我的天啊

102
00:07:31,850 --> 00:07:36,340
I told you you were a bath person. Hey, maybe I can give you a facial.
我說過你會喜歡洗澡 或許我可以幫你做臉

103
00:07:37,290 --> 00:07:39,520
I'm gonna need a bigger boat.
我需要大一點的船

104
00:07:48,860 --> 00:07:52,090
I don't think you had an open mind about the name Ruth.
我覺得你對蘿絲這個名字 沒有抱著開闊的胸襟

105
00:07:52,270 --> 00:07:55,570
I mean, come on, little Ruthie Geller? How cute is that?
拜託嘛，小蘿絲蓋勒 可愛吧？

106
00:07:55,770 --> 00:07:59,970
Oh, my God, I can practically hear the mahjong tiles.
天啊 我可以聽到麻將聲

107
00:08:01,140 --> 00:08:06,600
Okay. All your tests look fine. Are you interested in knowing the sex of the baby?
好了，檢查結果都很正常 你們想知道寶寶的性別嗎？

108
00:08:06,810 --> 00:08:10,840
-No, we're not. -But you have it right there in that file?
-我們不想知道 -但病歷裡面有記錄？

109
00:08:11,120 --> 00:08:13,250
You could tell us whether it's a boy or a girl?
你可以告訴我們 是男孩或是女孩？

110
00:08:13,420 --> 00:08:16,820
Dayton or Sandrene? Phoebe or Pheebo?
戴頓或珊德妮？ 菲比或菲寶？

111
00:08:17,020 --> 00:08:19,490
That's right. But if you don't wanna know..
沒錯 如果你們不想知道

112
00:08:19,660 --> 00:08:23,460
-No, we wanna wait. Right? -Right. Right.
-不，我們要等，對吧？ -對

113
00:08:24,700 --> 00:08:26,860
Oh, I'll be right back.
我馬上回來

114
00:08:27,470 --> 00:08:30,160
I know it's really not my place..
我知道我不該那麼說

115
00:08:30,370 --> 00:08:33,830
but please don't name your child Pheebo.
但請不要將你們的寶寶 取名為菲寶

116
00:08:38,710 --> 00:08:42,210
So which of these babies do you think is the ugliest?
你覺得哪個寶寶最醜？

117
00:08:42,480 --> 00:08:45,380
What? Rach, come on, that's terrible.
什麼？瑞秋，那太可怕了

118
00:08:45,620 --> 00:08:48,490
They're babies. They're all beautiful.
他們是寶寶 他們都很可愛

119
00:08:48,690 --> 00:08:52,130
-Third one from the left? -Yeah. Why is it staring at me?
-左邊數過來第三個？ -對，它為什麼要盯著我看？

120
00:08:52,990 --> 00:08:59,190
I think it knows I'm talking about it. Don't you..? You're looking!
我想它知道我在說它 你不…你在偷看

121
00:08:59,400 --> 00:09:00,870
-I didn't! -I saw you!
-我沒有 -我看到了

122
00:09:01,070 --> 00:09:03,590
Fine, I did, but I didn't see anything.
好吧，我在偷看 但我什麼都沒有看到

123
00:09:03,770 --> 00:09:07,370
Shame on you! Ugly baby judges you!
你太可恥了，丑寶寶唾棄你

124
00:09:07,880 --> 00:09:12,070
-Okay. But listen to me, I didn't.. -Don't tell me! I don't wanna know!
-好吧，聽我說，我沒有… -別告訴我，我不想知道

125
00:09:12,410 --> 00:09:14,850
I couldn't even if I wanted to, because I don't know!
我想說也沒辦法說 因為我不知道

126
00:09:15,020 --> 00:09:19,920
I swear I didn't see anything! I don't want to know. It was just a momentary lapse.
我發誓我什麼都沒看到，我不想知道 剛剛我是一時糊塗

127
00:09:20,090 --> 00:09:23,280
Momentary lapse? Don't you have any self-control?
一時糊塗？ 你不懂得自製嗎？

128
00:09:23,520 --> 00:09:26,860
Okay. A couple months late on the lecture, Ross.
好吧，現在跟我說教 已經遲了好幾個月，羅斯

129
00:09:31,300 --> 00:09:32,770
Hello?
哈囉

130
00:09:32,970 --> 00:09:36,960
I'm in the bathroom. Can you come in here? I think there's something wrong.
我在浴室，你能進來一下嗎？ 我覺得不太對勁

131
00:09:37,240 --> 00:09:40,260
You know what? I think I'll wait out here.
你知道嗎？ 我在這裡等

132
00:09:40,740 --> 00:09:43,230
I'm in the bathtub.
我在浴缸裡

133
00:09:47,210 --> 00:09:50,450
-What's wrong? -I drew my own bath, but I did it wrong.
-怎麼了？ -我自己放洗澡水，但我沒有弄對

134
00:09:50,620 --> 00:09:55,350
The water's tepid, the salt didn't dissolve and is now lodged places.
水溫溫的，浴鹽無法溶解 現在它們結塊了

135
00:09:56,560 --> 00:10:01,490
And the scents I used don't compliment each other. Eucalyptus and chamomile?
我用的香味聞起來很不協調 尤加利樹跟甘菊？

136
00:10:02,560 --> 00:10:05,230
-What? -Bath salts.
-什麼？ -浴鹽

137
00:10:05,500 --> 00:10:07,800
They're starting to effervesce.
它們開始冒泡了

138
00:10:08,440 --> 00:10:10,400
It's different.
感覺完全不同

139
00:10:11,540 --> 00:10:13,560
It's interesting.
這真的很有趣

140
00:10:14,510 --> 00:10:16,740
Okay. Let's talk about something else.
好吧，我們談談別的事

141
00:10:16,910 --> 00:10:20,810
Yeah. Sure. So, what was going on with you today?
當然 今天你過得還好吧？

142
00:10:22,620 --> 00:10:26,350
I actually had the weirdest conversation with Joey.
我跟喬伊 談了一件很奇怪的事

143
00:10:26,620 --> 00:10:30,110
He was talking about rules and right and wrong.
他談到規則及對錯

144
00:10:30,320 --> 00:10:34,420
-I had the same conversation. -You did? What was he talking about?
-我也跟他談過 -是嗎？他到底在說什麼？

145
00:10:34,630 --> 00:10:39,070
He hasn't had this much trouble getting out words since we saw him in Macbeth.
自從他演過馬克白後 我還沒看過他說不出話的樣子

146
00:10:40,840 --> 00:10:42,500
That was a long night.
那是漫長的一夜

147
00:10:43,900 --> 00:10:47,030
All right, let's break this down. What exactly did he say to you?
好吧，我們來談談這件事 他到底跟你說了什麼？

148
00:10:47,270 --> 00:10:52,340
He was talking about rules and looking at people differently.
他說到規則 對別人有不同的看法

149
00:10:52,610 --> 00:10:54,880
-He didn't say that to me. -What'd he tell you?
-他沒有跟我說那個 -他跟你說了什麼？

150
00:10:55,120 --> 00:10:58,180
He was asking questions about you, me and London.
他問到你跟我 在倫敦發生的事

151
00:10:58,450 --> 00:11:01,890
And the glue that holds this all together, the rules.
我們是怎麼開始的 還有規則

152
00:11:02,820 --> 00:11:06,760
Okay. So you, me and London.
好吧，你跟我在倫敦

153
00:11:06,990 --> 00:11:09,220
Looking at people differently.
對別人有不同的看法

154
00:11:09,900 --> 00:11:13,590
Maybe he wants to do what you and I did in London with someone.
或許他想跟某人 發生你跟我在倫敦發生的事

155
00:11:13,770 --> 00:11:15,130
But what'd he mean by "rules"?
但他說「規則」是什麼意思？

156
00:11:16,300 --> 00:11:20,140
Wait. He stopped talking the minute Phoebe came in.
等一下，菲比走進來時 他就不說了

157
00:11:20,370 --> 00:11:24,500
-Because he was looking at her differently. -And Phoebe is his friend.
-因為他用不同的眼光看她 -菲比是他的朋友

158
00:11:24,680 --> 00:11:26,840
So he thinks that would be breaking the rules.
他覺得那違反了規則

159
00:11:27,050 --> 00:11:30,310
My God, he wants to do it with Phoebe in London!
天啊，他想跟菲比在倫敦上床

160
00:11:30,820 --> 00:11:33,810
-You guys? -Just a minute!
-你們在哪裡？ -等一下

161
00:11:34,190 --> 00:11:38,350
-That's Mrs. Tribbiani. -You don't say anything.
-崔比亞尼太太來了 -什麼都別說

162
00:11:38,590 --> 00:11:40,560
Why would I say anything?
我為什麼要說？

163
00:11:40,730 --> 00:11:44,290
That two of our friends could start the greatest love affair of their lives?
我們的兩個好朋友 要真正地談戀愛？

164
00:11:44,470 --> 00:11:48,160
They would have me to thank. Then we could all start having babies!
他們會謝謝我 然後我們可以開始做寶寶

165
00:11:49,270 --> 00:11:52,540
-I'm not gonna let you say anything. -You just stay here.
-我不要你告訴她 -你待在這裡

166
00:11:52,770 --> 00:11:54,900
Oh, God!
天啊

167
00:11:58,950 --> 00:12:00,850
Hey, Monica, I brought back your iron.
摩妮卡，我拿熨斗來還你

168
00:12:01,020 --> 00:12:04,580
Oh, you had that? I thought I lost it. I got a new one a month ago.
是你把它拿走的？我以為我弄丟了它 一個月前我買了一個新的

169
00:12:04,750 --> 00:12:06,910
Oh, just as well. I broke this one.
太好了，我把它弄壞了

170
00:12:12,860 --> 00:12:14,590
-What? -Nothing.
-什麼？ -沒事

171
00:12:14,900 --> 00:12:16,333
Okay.
好吧

172
00:12:16,900 --> 00:12:20,730
I really shouldn't say. I'm really not supposed to.
我真的不該說 我不應該說出來的

173
00:12:20,970 --> 00:12:22,230
Fine.
好吧

174
00:12:22,800 --> 00:12:25,140
It's a humdinger.
這是個好消息

175
00:12:25,670 --> 00:12:28,300
Well, then it's really too bad that you can't tell me.
可惜你不能告訴我

176
00:12:28,510 --> 00:12:29,870
Somebody likes you!
有人喜歡你

177
00:12:34,120 --> 00:12:35,550
Is it Chandler?
是錢德嗎？

178
00:12:36,920 --> 00:12:39,910
-No! -Then tell him to stop staring.
-不 -叫他別再盯著我看

179
00:12:40,960 --> 00:12:42,180
It's Joey.
是喬伊

180
00:12:42,990 --> 00:12:47,090
Really? Joey? You don't say.
真的嗎？喬伊？你騙人

181
00:12:47,290 --> 00:12:51,660
-Is it something you'd be interested in? -I don't know, I don't know.
-你會有興趣嗎？ -我不知道

182
00:12:52,470 --> 00:12:56,030
You know, I mean, on the one hand, "Mother, may I?"
我是說 一方面 我在想 「天啊，我可以嗎？」

183
00:12:57,970 --> 00:13:01,140
But, you know, on the other hand..
但在另一方面

184
00:13:02,140 --> 00:13:05,770
No. No, I can't. We're friends.
不行，我們是朋友

185
00:13:06,010 --> 00:13:08,680
Oh, no. I don't wanna risk what we have.
不，我不能冒險 失去我們現在的友誼

186
00:13:08,920 --> 00:13:14,150
I guess that makes sense. You think you're gonna talk to him?
我猜你說的對 你會跟他談一談嗎？

187
00:13:14,360 --> 00:13:18,310
Sure. I mean, it's Joey. I don't want him to get hurt.
當然，他是喬伊 我不希望他受傷害

188
00:13:19,330 --> 00:13:22,920
Well, I must say, I am on fire! First Chandler, now Joey.
我得說我真的很辣 先是錢德，現在又是喬伊

189
00:13:24,170 --> 00:13:28,000
-Not Chandler. Just Joey. -Sure.
-沒有錢德，只有喬伊 -當然

190
00:13:35,540 --> 00:13:39,210
You know what? I've been thinking about it. I'm coming around on the name Ruth.
你知道嗎？我想過了 我接受蘿絲這個名字

191
00:13:39,380 --> 00:13:42,110
I think I would actually consider naming our child that.
我可以考慮 幫孩子取那個名字

192
00:13:42,820 --> 00:13:47,150
Rach, I can't tell you how much that means to me.
瑞秋，我無法告訴你 這對我來說意義有多麼重大

193
00:13:50,160 --> 00:13:52,180
Wait a minute.
等一下

194
00:13:52,790 --> 00:13:58,700
Wait a minute. You hated the name Ruth. Why would you change your mind?
等一下，你討厭蘿絲這個名字 你為什麼會改變心意？

195
00:13:58,970 --> 00:14:02,630
Unless you know we're never gonna have to use it.
除非你知道 我們用不著它

196
00:14:02,870 --> 00:14:05,700
You did see. You know it's a boy!
你看到了，你知道寶寶是男孩

197
00:14:05,970 --> 00:14:09,200
I didn't see anything. I actually changed my mind about the name.
我什麼都沒有看到 我真的是改變了心意

198
00:14:09,440 --> 00:14:12,310
I don't think so. You're giving me Ruth..
我不那麼認為 你答應讓我選蘿絲

199
00:14:12,580 --> 00:14:15,780
so you get to name him when it's a boy.
如果你生了兒子 你可以幫他取名字

200
00:14:16,020 --> 00:14:21,890
That's when you'll swoop in and name him Heath or Blaine or Sequoia.
那時候你會決定叫他 海瑟，布蘭恩或史奎亞

201
00:14:22,120 --> 00:14:24,390
I would.. Sequoia!
我會…史奎亞

202
00:14:24,630 --> 00:14:27,620
-Veto. -Fine.
-否決 -好吧

203
00:14:30,400 --> 00:14:32,460
Unless..
除非…

204
00:14:33,230 --> 00:14:36,730
you anticipated that I would figure all this out..
你知道我會看穿你的陰謀

205
00:14:36,970 --> 00:14:40,340
and you know that it actually is a girl.
你知道寶寶是女生

206
00:14:40,540 --> 00:14:44,030
And you really do want her to be named Ruth.
你真的希望她叫蘿絲

207
00:14:44,250 --> 00:14:49,910
Well, I'm not falling for that! Okay? Ruth is off the table!
我才不會上當 好吧？我們不考慮蘿絲

208
00:14:50,180 --> 00:14:55,050
-But, Ross, you want the name Ruth. -Not like this!
-但羅斯，你要蘿絲這個名字 -現在我不要了

209
00:14:57,396 --> 00:14:59,364
-嗨 -嗨

210
00:14:59,860 --> 00:15:01,330
What's up?
怎麼了？

211
00:15:01,630 --> 00:15:05,690
-Joey, I know. -What?
-喬伊，我知道了 -什麼？

212
00:15:07,130 --> 00:15:10,800
-I know. -What?
-我知道了 -什麼？

213
00:15:11,910 --> 00:15:16,140
-I know about your feelings. -Oh, my God, you do?
-我瞭解你的感覺 -天啊，真的嗎？

214
00:15:16,340 --> 00:15:21,540
I'm sorry. Things worked out for Chandler and Monica, but that's rare.
我很遺憾，雖然錢德跟摩妮卡成功了 但那是少之又少的例子

215
00:15:21,780 --> 00:15:26,950
I know. And this is so much more complicated than it was for those guys.
我知道 這比他們的情況複雜多了

216
00:15:27,220 --> 00:15:29,620
I mean, it's Rachel, for God's sakes.
我是說她是瑞秋，天啊

217
00:15:31,530 --> 00:15:34,790
For God's sakes, it's Rachel!
天啊，是瑞秋

218
00:15:35,730 --> 00:15:40,190
I know! She's not only my friend, she's my pregnant friend.
我知道，她不只是我的朋友 她是我的孕婦朋友

219
00:15:40,430 --> 00:15:43,200
She's my pregnant friend who's Ross 'ex!
她是我的孕婦朋友 還是羅斯的前女友

220
00:15:43,440 --> 00:15:45,560
Yeah, that's Rachel.
對，那就是瑞秋

221
00:15:45,870 --> 00:15:47,500
Beat me over the head with it.
我真的被搞糊塗了

222
00:15:50,040 --> 00:15:54,670
What am I gonna do? I keep trying to get rid of these feelings.
我該怎麼辦？ 我試著不去想這些事

223
00:15:54,880 --> 00:15:58,680
I stayed up all last night and made a list of everything I don't like about her.
昨晚我整夜沒睡 試著寫出我不喜歡她的地方

224
00:15:58,850 --> 00:16:00,720
-You wanna hear it? -Yeah.
-你想聽聽看嗎？ -好

225
00:16:03,890 --> 00:16:09,260
"She made me switch to light mayo." That's it! That's all I got!
「她要我改吃低卡美乃滋」 就那樣，我只想到那個

226
00:16:09,460 --> 00:16:12,830
You know what? Tastes the same and my pants fit better.
你知道嗎？味道一樣 但我的褲子松多了

227
00:16:14,500 --> 00:16:18,630
Joey, I think you're getting upset for nothing. This is probably just a crush.
喬伊，我覺得你是庸人自擾 或許你只是被愛情沖昏了頭

228
00:16:19,070 --> 00:16:20,300
You think?
你真的那麼認為？

229
00:16:20,470 --> 00:16:24,410
Absolutely. You get this rush of feelings, but then it goes away.
當然，你只是一時昏了頭 但那種感覺會消失的

230
00:16:24,610 --> 00:16:29,110
Yeah, just a crush. That's all this is. It's a crush!
對，我只是沖昏了頭 沒錯，我只是沖昏了頭

231
00:16:29,350 --> 00:16:32,220
I'm Joey. I don't get deep feelings.
我是喬伊，我不會玩真的

232
00:16:32,420 --> 00:16:35,320
There you go. Crushes happen all the time.
好了 人常會被沖昏了頭

233
00:16:35,590 --> 00:16:39,150
I know I've had them for all you guys. Except for Ross and Chandler.
我對你們這些男生也會有那種感覺 羅斯跟錢德除外

234
00:16:40,960 --> 00:16:44,950
-And I'm sure you've had them for us. -Not really.
-我相信你對我們也是 -不盡然

235
00:16:46,630 --> 00:16:48,360
Throw me a bone here.
丟根骨頭給我

236
00:16:56,740 --> 00:17:00,770
So I called the doctor.
我打電話給醫生了

237
00:17:01,350 --> 00:17:05,510
-Now we both know the sex of the baby. -What?
-現在我們都知道寶寶的性別 -什麼？

238
00:17:05,750 --> 00:17:09,850
That's right. The student has become the master.
沒錯 我是青出於藍勝於藍

239
00:17:10,320 --> 00:17:16,020
-Ross, I swear. I don't know. -Oh, come on, you know it's a girl.
-羅斯，我發誓我真的不知道 -少來了，你知道寶寶是女孩

240
00:17:16,230 --> 00:17:17,700
A what?
什麼？

241
00:17:19,070 --> 00:17:20,290
You really didn't know?
你真的不知道？

242
00:17:20,470 --> 00:17:22,990
-We're having a girl? -No.
-我們要有個女兒了？ -不

243
00:17:23,270 --> 00:17:25,100
-That's what you said. -No.
-你是那麼說的 -不

244
00:17:25,340 --> 00:17:29,440
-You said girl. -Yes. I'm sorry. I'm so sorry.
-你說它是女孩 -對，我真的很抱歉

245
00:17:29,640 --> 00:17:32,010
I'm not! We're having a girl!
沒關係，我們要有個女兒了

246
00:17:32,280 --> 00:17:37,220
Sometimes I can't believe it's with you, but still, we're having a girl!
有時候我不敢相信孩子的爸是你 但我們要有個女兒了

247
00:17:37,820 --> 00:17:42,810
I know! You know what? I'm putting Ruth back on the table.
我知道，你知道嗎？ 我要重新考慮蘿絲這個名字

248
00:17:43,020 --> 00:17:46,320
Yes, we'll have ourselves a little baby Ruth.
對，我們要生下小蘿絲了

249
00:17:50,830 --> 00:17:53,300
-Permission to veto. -Yes, please.
-請求否決 -好吧，否決

250
00:18:00,710 --> 00:18:02,870
Do I smell essential oils?
這是精油味嗎？

251
00:18:03,080 --> 00:18:06,570
Yeah. I'm gonna take a bath. I was just gonna get a magazine.
對，我要去洗澡 我想拿本雜誌

252
00:18:22,760 --> 00:18:24,230
What do you think you're doing?
你覺得你在做什麼？

253
00:18:26,130 --> 00:18:28,500
Leaving my troubles behind?
忘了我的麻煩？

254
00:18:29,470 --> 00:18:33,770
I know that you're new at this, but this is unacceptable bath decorum.
我知道你是新手 但這不合乎洗澡的禮儀

255
00:18:34,010 --> 00:18:37,640
It's so hard to care when you're this relaxed.
看到你這麼輕鬆 我真的很難挑剔

256
00:18:38,150 --> 00:18:41,880
Okay, fine. You can have the bath, but I am taking your boat.
好吧，你可以洗澡 但我要拿走你的船

257
00:18:42,280 --> 00:18:44,150
Now you're just a girl in a tub.
現在你是愛洗澡的女生

258
00:18:48,120 --> 00:18:49,680
Hi, bubbles. Manly.
嗨，泡泡澡，太有男子氣概了

259
00:18:51,090 --> 00:18:53,750
I thought I would drop by and let you know how it went.
我想順道過來 告訴你結果

260
00:18:53,960 --> 00:18:55,790
You told her?
你跟她說了？

261
00:18:56,230 --> 00:19:00,560
She pulled it out of me! She's like a conversational wizard!
是她套我的 她真的很會逼別人

262
00:19:00,730 --> 00:19:04,640
-How did it go? -You were wrong. He doesn't like me.
-結果如何？ -你錯了，他不喜歡我

263
00:19:04,840 --> 00:19:08,140
How would you like it if I sent you to Lee Majors' house..
你會有什麼感覺 如果我把你送到李梅傑的家

264
00:19:08,310 --> 00:19:10,440
and I told you he liked you and you went there..
我告訴你他喜歡你 你跑進去…

265
00:19:10,610 --> 00:19:13,740
and you found out that he didn't like you. How would you feel?
發現他並不喜歡你 你會有什麼感覺？

266
00:19:16,920 --> 00:19:20,350
-I don't think I'd care. -Really? Lee Majors is hot.
-我想我不會在乎 -真的嗎？李梅傑很性感

267
00:19:22,220 --> 00:19:26,220
-Hello? -We're in the bathroom!
-哈囉 -我們在浴室裡

268
00:19:26,730 --> 00:19:30,790
-Why? -Because it's a relaxing and enjoyable time!
-為什麼？ -因為它既輕鬆又有趣

269
00:19:33,300 --> 00:19:36,960
-What are you guys doing in here? -Oh, my God.
-你們在這裡做什麼？ -天啊

270
00:19:37,200 --> 00:19:41,800
A friend he's looking at differently, but it's wrong.
他對一個朋友的感覺不一樣 但那是不對的

271
00:19:42,040 --> 00:19:44,440
-It's Rachel! -You like Rachel?
-是瑞秋 -你喜歡瑞秋？

272
00:19:44,650 --> 00:19:49,510
It's no big deal. Phoebe and I talked. It's a crush. It'll go away.
那沒什麼了不起的，菲比跟我談過 我只是沖昏了頭，我會清醒過來的

273
00:19:49,720 --> 00:19:51,780
Dude, you gotta rearrange your bubbles.
你得重新排列 泡泡的位置

274
00:19:54,720 --> 00:19:56,990
Mazel tov.
恭喜你

275
00:19:58,330 --> 00:20:01,990
Ross and I were looking for you.
羅斯跟我在找你們

276
00:20:02,230 --> 00:20:06,500
What are we all doing in here? Oh, my.
我們在這裡做什麼？天啊

277
00:20:08,200 --> 00:20:13,230
-Honey, cover it up with the boat. -It's not an aircraft carrier.
-用船把它蓋起來 -它不是航空母艦

278
00:20:14,710 --> 00:20:15,940
Hello?
哈囉

279
00:20:16,140 --> 00:20:20,080
We're all in here, and we'd love for you to join us!
我們都在這裡 希望你能加入我們

280
00:20:21,980 --> 00:20:28,010
Well, hey! What's going on? Oh, cool boat. Oh, no.
嘿，發生了什麼事？ 很酷的船，不

281
00:20:29,990 --> 00:20:32,750
-Did you tell them? -No. I was waiting for you.
-你告訴他們了嗎？ -不，我在等你

282
00:20:32,960 --> 00:20:35,490
-Tell us what? -We're having a girl.
-告訴我們什麼？ -我們懷的是女兒

283
00:20:35,730 --> 00:20:38,250
Oh, wow! Really?
哇，真的嗎？

284
00:20:41,870 --> 00:20:43,300
I'll get you later.
我待會再加入你們

285
00:20:50,310 --> 00:20:54,300
All right. It's a new day. And it's just a crush.
好吧，這是全新的一天 我只是被沖昏了頭

286
00:20:54,580 --> 00:20:57,240
That's all. Just a little crush.
沒錯，我沖昏了頭

287
00:20:57,480 --> 00:21:01,280
All that worrying I was doing? That was crazy.
我到底在擔心什麼？ 那太瘋狂了

288
00:21:01,560 --> 00:21:05,460
Like my friend the bird here would say, "It was cuckoo!"
我的小鳥朋友會說 「那跟瘋子一樣」

289
00:21:09,600 --> 00:21:13,120
Everything's gonna be fine. It's just a crush.
一切都會沒事 我只是沖昏了頭

290
00:21:14,900 --> 00:21:18,700
-Hi, sweetie. -I love you.
-嗨，甜心 -我愛你

291
00:21:26,150 --> 00:21:28,810
It's nice to do this together, isn't it?
我們能一起這麼做 真的很棒吧？

292
00:21:30,220 --> 00:21:33,650
Yeah. And what you're doing feels so good.
對，你讓我感覺很好

293
00:21:33,850 --> 00:21:35,850
I'm not touching you.
我沒有碰你

294
00:21:36,990 --> 00:21:39,360
-You're not? -It's the salts.
-是嗎？ -那是浴鹽

295
